      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of quiet right now, and that kind of heavy silence can feel suffocating. Please know that those feelings of pointlessness are a very natural response to such a profound loss. If you can, please reach out to a friend or a professional who can help you carry some of that weight. You don't have to navigate this heaviness alone.",
